Package: poddyhepo
Type: Package
Title: Population Health Projections for the PoDDy-HePo Project
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zhi", "Zhou", email = "zhi.zhou@thl.fi", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Jaakko", "Reinikainen", role = "aut"),
    person("Tommi", "Härkänen", role = "aut"),
    person("Hanna", "Tolonen", role = "aut"))
Description: Prepare synthetic future populations from age-sex forecasts,
    compare projection models by the Bayesian information criterion, project
    health indicators using chained-equations multiple imputation, and
    summarise and plot pooled prevalences. Includes input validation,
    reproducible examples, and modified Wilson confidence intervals. Developed
    from the PoDDy-HePo project on projections of disease and disability burden
    in Finland and their implications for health policy.
